"US-1305 Quality signals next to cost (EPIC-13, docs/features/epic-13-insights.md): per intent, revision cycles per stage, loop-backs from Build and Test, review findings and whether they were fixed, failed test runs, and \"After merge with main\" findings in test-results.md; per release, the EPIC-00 fix stories that trace back to it and whether it was marked a prerelease; a chart that puts cost and quality side by side per intent so an expensive and troubled intent stands out; every text through t() in Swedish and English, LCARS look. Builds on US-1301 (rework cost) and US-1304 (delivery metrics)."
